_model: prematter
---
title: Copyright information
---
body:

<h2>Content of this site</h2>

<p>The textual narrative, diagrams, proposition layout, page
structure, and accompanying images in the following directories are
<strong>© David E. Joyce</strong>, used by his permission:

<ul>
  <li><a href="/elements/">/elements/</a> &mdash; Euclid&rsquo;s
      <em>Elements</em>, Books I&ndash;XIII</li>
  <li><a href="/other-works/compass-geometry/">/other-works/compass-geometry/</a> &mdash;
      Compass Geometry tutorial</li>
  <li><a href="/other-works/round-triangles/">/other-works/round-triangles/</a>,
      <a href="/other-works/six-circles-eight-points/">/other-works/six-circles-eight-points/</a>,
      <a href="/other-works/desargues-theorem/">/other-works/desargues-theorem/</a>
      &mdash; spherical / inversive geometry tutorials</li>
  <li><a href="/other-works/euler-line/">/other-works/euler-line/</a>
      &mdash; Euler line demo</li>
</ul>

<p>Dr. Joyce created these materials between 1996 and 2020 for his
online <em>Elements</em> edition at Clark University. Nelson Brown
received permission in May 2026 to republish the content and port
the underlying applet to TypeScript as
<a href="/geomlib/"><tt>geomlib</tt></a>.

<p>Third parties wishing to redistribute Dr. Joyce&rsquo;s narrative
content should obtain separate permission from him.

<h2>Linking</h2>

<p>All rights are reserved for narrative content on this site. Web
links may be freely made to either
<a href="http://aleph0.clarku.edu/~djoyce/elements/elements.html">the
original at Clark University</a> or this site.

<h2>The geomlib library itself</h2>

<p>The TypeScript library is open source under the MIT License with
joint copyright: © 1996&ndash;2020 David E. Joyce, 2019&ndash;2026
Nelson Brown. Source available at
<a href="https://github.com/brownnrl/euclid">github.com/brownnrl/euclid</a>
and published on npm as
<a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/@brownnrl/geomlib"><tt>@brownnrl/geomlib</tt></a>.
